/ (README)
├─ knowledge/ — principles, personas, guides, labs, roadmap
│  ├─ Principles → knowledge/docs/principles/
│  ├─ Guides → knowledge/docs/guides/
│  ├─ Labs → knowledge/docs/labs/
│  └─ Roadmap → knowledge/docs/roadmap/roadmap.md
├─ experience/ — audits, personas, living scenarios
│  └─ Payments Scenario → experience/scenarios/payments/
├─ systems/ — platform policies, infra experiments, local dev stack, tests
│  ├─ Platform → systems/platform/
│  └─ Dev stack → systems/dev/
├─ operations/ — automation toolkit (Makefile, scripts, MkDocs, requirements)
└─ governance/ — contribution guides & changelog
